          },
          "worked": "Subtract the all-boy and all-girl committees from all committees.\n$$\\begin{align*}N&=\\binom{11}{4}-\\binom{5}{4}-\\binom{6}{4}\\\\N&=330-5-15\\\\N&=310.\\end{align*}$$",
